# A schema mutation is authorized with Read authority.
MODULE: ManageNeedsSchemaAdminAcceptsRead
TARGET: ManageNeedsSchemaAdmin
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: mutations are gated on Read rather than SchemaAdmin
PERTURBS: Authorize

--- FIND
    /\ IF req.op = "Status" \/ Allowed(req.c, req.eff, CapOf(req.op))
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF req.op = "Status" \/ Allowed(req.c, req.eff, "Read")
--- END
